    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 pb-16 lg:pb-24">
      <div class="prose prose-lg prose-blue max-w-none text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
        <p class="text-2xl font-medium text-gray-900 mb-8 italic">
          Treadmill parts are not hard to buy. They are easy to buy wrong. The same model name can cover
          several versions built years apart with different motors, belts and boards, and the only reliable
          way to tell them apart is the model and serial number on the frame. Find that first, and the rest
          of this page is a matter of choosing who to buy from.
        </p>

        <div id="at-a-glance" class="scroll-mt-24">
