<p>
            The parts that wear or fail most often, what they do, and the scale of what they cost. The prices
            are from one independent parts seller, FitnessRepairParts, for one home treadmill, a NordicTrack
            C2000, on 5 November 2026; parts for other machines differ, but the proportions hold.
          </p>
